{"is_source_file": true, "format": "Python", "description": "This file defines a Python class `GStreamerPipelineSource` that integrates GStreamer pipelines as media sources within the Pipecat framework. It manages the creation, control, and processing of GStreamer pipelines for audio and video frames, including handling pipeline lifecycle events, decoding, format filtering, and providing output frames through custom callbacks. The file also defines nested configuration data classes and handles external GStreamer modules, with logic for starting, stopping, and canceling GStreamer pipelines during frame processing.", "external_files": ["pipecat.frames.frames", "pipecat.processors.frame_processor", "loguru", "pydantic"], "external_methods": ["Gst.parse_bin_from_description", "Gst.ElementFactory.make", "GstCaps.from_string", "Gst.Pipeline.new", "Gst.Bus.get_signal_watch", "Gst.Bus.add_signal_watch", "Gst.Bus.connect", "Gst.Element.link", "Gst.Element.get_static_pad", "Gst.Buffer.map", "Gst.Buffer.unmap", "Gst.FlowReturn.OK"], "published": ["GStreamerPipelineSource"], "classes": [{"name": "GStreamerPipelineSource", "description": "A frame processor that uses GStreamer pipelines as media sources, capable of configuring, controlling, and processing media streams for audio and video output within the Pipecat framework."}, {"name": "OutputParams", "description": "Configuration class for output media parameters such as resolution, sample rate, channels, and synchronization settings."}], "methods": [{"name": "__init__(self, *, pipeline: str, out_params: Optional[OutputParams] = None, **kwargs)", "description": "Constructs the GStreamer pipeline source, initializing pipelines, connecting decodebin signals, and setting up buses.", "scope": "GStreamerPipelineSource", "scopeKind": "class"}, {"name": "process_frame(self, frame: Frame, direction: FrameDirection)", "description": "Processes incoming frames, managing pipeline start/stop/cancel events based on frame types.", "scope": "